// @id 01M61KJ9DSD4FKH72YF79K6RTP model=basic-example
q: How is displacement vector calculated in 3d space?
a: $$\boldsymbol{r}(t) = x(t)\hat{\boldsymbol{\imath}} + y(t)\hat{\boldsymbol{\jmath}} + z(t)\hat{\boldsymbol{k}}$$

// @id 01M61KJ9DS8KCGWR8GVGDCX38M model=basic-example
q: How would 3D velocity vector be written in Newton's dot notation?
a: $$\boldsymbol{v} = \dot{\boldsymbol{r}} = (\dot{x}, \dot{y}, \dot{z})$$

// @id 01M61KJ9DSMJ76TEA481ERNJ4P model=basic-example
q: How would 3D acceleration vector be written in Newton's dot notation?
a: $$\boldsymbol{a} = \dot{\boldsymbol{v}} = (\ddot{x}, \ddot{y}, \ddot{z})$$
